reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tPor <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/jamesthomas741\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/a49dfce04075cac829ee19a4721688d026f09ad10327744456b4332e3d720ede?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/a49dfce04075cac829ee19a4721688d026f09ad10327744456b4332e3d720ede?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/jamesthomas741\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">jamesthomas741<\/a> el <span class=\"review-date\">mayo 5, 2025<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Very easy to create your own designs or pull in templates to adjust. Only downside is when creating a large page the editor can run a little bit slow at times. <\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Elementor \u00e8 il migliore!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 de 5 estrellas\" data-title-template=\"%s de 5 estrellas\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tPor <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/oceanoinfinito\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/cad0b959cf00fc0b4802fe770abed6c2a5e108277c0e4b5fdfb26c3530ef7f7a?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/cad0b959cf00fc0