                (
                    [body] => {"name":"Elementor Website Builder &#8211; More Than Just a Page Builder","slug":"elementor","version":"3.29.1","author":"<a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/elemntor\/\">Elementor<\/a>","author_profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/elemntor\/","contributors":{"elemntor":{"profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/elemntor\/","avatar":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/7d70f15d78757f876d1847a8f87dd93e1d9c168264b4aeeaf72058656690d05b?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g","display_name":"Elementor"}},"requires":"6.5","tested":"6.7.2","requires_php":"7.4","requires_plugins":[],"rating":90,"ratings":{"5":6018,"4":215,"3":103,"2":102,"1":612},"num_ratings":7050,"support_url":"https:\/\/wordpress.org\/support\/plugin\/elementor\/","support_threads":92,"support_threads_resolved":17,"active_installs":10000000,"last_updated":"2025-05-28 9:50am GMT","added":"2016-05-30","homepage":"https:\/\/elementor.com\/?utm_source=wp-plugins&utm_campaign=plugin-uri&utm_medium=wp-dash","sections":{"description":"<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Elementor - The Leading Platform for Web Creators\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/le72grP_Q6k?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/p>\n<h4>THE #1 NO CODE DRAG &amp; DROP WORDPRESS WEBSITE BUILDER POWERING OVER 18M WEBSITES WORLDWIDE, NOW WITH AI.<\/h4>\n<p>Elementor, la plataforma l\u00edder de creaci\u00f3n de sitios web en WordPress, te permite crear sitios web profesionales con p\u00edxeles perfectos sin problemas.<\/p>\n<p>Unlock all features with <a href=\"https:\/\/go.elementor.com\/wp-repo-description-tab-elementor-pro-pro-features\/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Elementor Pro<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00bfNecesitas alojamiento en la nube r\u00e1pido y seguro para tu sitio Elementor? Prueba <strong